* The native digital pins have the verified state/sink/source event ABI.
* The final TAP is genuine analog, carrying the 1k physical load.
.subckt SR_NATIVE_MIXED_BUFFER D D_SINK D_SOURCE Q Q_SINK Q_SOURCE TAP
Xcore D D_SINK D_SOURCE Q Q_SINK Q_SOURCE SRALB0
Rphysical TAP 0 1k
.ends SR_NATIVE_MIXED_BUFFER
